WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.203
A year ago, you had one voice note. Just one.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.134
Now look. There's you… and everyone who holds you up.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.079
Your children's leaves. Her first 'Ammamma', in that funny accent.

4
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.266
And above, where it all began. Fifty-two Sundays of her stories.

5
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.071
[Ammamma, voice note] Mole, kettoo… nee kazhicho?

6
00:00:35.121 --> 00:00:36.580
(My girl, did you eat?)

7
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.541
[Child] Again!

8
00:00:40.591 --> 00:00:43.636
The first leaf is still the one you play the most.

